# Retired model versions stay local: only the latest version is published.
/reconstructions/bundeshaus/archive/

# This repository is published to GitHub Pages: everything committed is public.
# Local outputs, downloads and tools stay out; each reconstruction may add more
# rules or exceptions (von-wattenwyl-haus publishes its viewer/output/).
output/
venv/
.venv/

# Large or derived formats that are never published as-is: trained splats and
# point clouds, raw scans and source scenes, plain IFC (the .ifczip is the
# published form), Matterport meshes, archives and partial downloads.
